ss now, the Landlord or teammate might play higher pairs later (like 10s, Qs, Ks, etc.), rendering your 8s useless. This is the perfect opportunity to play them.\n4. **Force Response**: By playing 88, you force the Landlord to either pass (giving you control to play your 5) or spend a high pair (like 10s, Qs, 2s) to beat you, weakening their hand.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♥8", "♦8"]}'}
